@api = https://api.themoviedb.org/3
@media_url = https://image.tmdb.org
// to load the API key in rest.nvim, add TMDB_API_KEY to `../.env` and run `Rest env` once before making requests
@api_key = {{TMDB_API_KEY}}

### movie
GET {{api}}/movie/703?language=de&api_key={{api_key}}

### search
GET {{api}}/search/movie?api_key={{api_key}}

### videos
GET {{api}}/movie/987/videos?api_key={{api_key}}

### configuration
GET {{api}}/configuration?api_key={{api_key}}

### movie images
GET {{api}}/movie/289/images?include_image_language&api_key={{api_key}}

### movie keywords
GET {{api}}/movie/266/images?include_image_language&api_key={{api_key}}

### movie release dates
GET {{api}}/movie/266/release_dates?api_key={{api_key}}

### credits
GET {{api}}/movie/266/credits?language=de&api_key={{api_key}}

### find by imdb_id
GET {{api}}/find/tt0057345?external_source=imdb_id&api_key={{api_key}}

### backdrop
GET {{media_url}}/t/p/w500/65VvjEscRHZNCCg63GmRfGU66v9.jpg

### poster
GET {{media_url}}/t/p/w500/aQUDdxuWQvXMGzZw0VmvGYrPtk9.jpg?language=fr

### genre
GET {{api}}/genre/movie/list/18?api_key={{api_key}}
